{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y2mPxCDEAPAyiazWQGGRig","type":"tool_result","content":"# daybook\n\nBackend of a small public work-journal site. Authors post short entries from anywhere\nin the world; every post card shows a date, and the home feed lists posts newest first.\n\n- `journal.py` — `publish(entry, client_tz)` is called by the API handler with the post\n  body and the IANA time zone the author's browser reports. `display_date(post, viewer_tz)`\n  is what the post card renders. `feed()` is the home feed.\n\nRun tests: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`\n./journal.py\n./README.md\n./.gitignore\n./tests/test_journal.py\n./tests/__init__.py\n./__pycache__/journal.cpython-314.pyc\n./tests/__pycache__/test_journal.cpython-314.pyc","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"998d6944-b96c-4e2a-a0df-9f2cb0cf9918","uuid":"aa13b449-46b1-480e-9784-8a4ecfdba458","timestamp":"2026-10-04T01:56:44.418Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# daybook\n\nBackend of a small public work-journal site. Authors post short entries from anywhere\nin the world; every post card shows a date, and the home feed lists posts newest first.\n\n- `journal.py` — `publish(entry, client_tz)` is called by the API handler with the post\n  body and the IANA time zone the author's browser reports. `display_date(post, viewer_tz)`\n  is what the post card renders. `feed()` is the home feed.\n\nRun tests: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`\n./journal.py\n./README.md\n./.gitignore\n./tests/test_journal.py\n./tests/__init__.py\n./__pycache__/journal.cpython-314.pyc\n./tests/__pycache__/test_journal.cpython-314.pyc","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
