{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfgNFx7VzZxxyh1mQZLwY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Posts now get the date it was in the author's own time zone when they published, and everyone sees that same date. All 10 tests pass: the 4 that were there before and 6 I added. Four of the new tests fail on the old code, which shows they catch the bugs.\n\n**Changes in `journal.py`:**\n- **`publish`** now takes the post's date from the author's own time zone (`client_tz`) instead of UTC. Before, someone in Tokyo posting on the morning of Mar 10 got Mar 9, and someone in Los Angeles posting on the evening of Mar 9 got Mar 10.\n- **`display_date`** now returns the stored date unchanged for every viewer. The old code converted the date via noon UTC, which still moved it a day for viewers at UTC+12 or beyond (e.g. Auckland in summer, Kiribati) and at UTC−12. A post's date is a calendar day, not a moment in time, so it shouldn't be converted at all.\n- **`feed`** now sorts by the actual publish time (`created_at`). Before, it sorted by date and then by author name, so posts from the same day came out alphabetically. Sorting by local date would also put posts from different zones in the wrong order.\n- If the browser sends a missing or invalid time zone, `publish` falls back to UTC instead of crashing.\n\n**Decisions for you:**\n- **Whose date to show:** every viewer sees the author's local date. If you'd rather each viewer see the post's date in their own zone, `display_date` would convert `created_at` into `viewer_tz`. That way a post could show different dates to different people, so I didn't do it.\n- **Old posts:** the store is in memory, so nothing needed migrating. If posts are kept anywhere else, their `date` values are still UTC dates and would need recomputing from `created_at` and `client_tz`.\n\nNothing is committed yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":460,"cache_read_input_tokens":24038,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":460},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"998d6944-b96c-4e2a-a0df-9f2cb0cf9918","uuid":"a8863363-596d-4ca5-be92-380c27250e17","timestamp":"2026-10-04T01:57:29.600Z","request_id":"req_011CfgNFwU4YkYfbY6HTLog4"}
